<!-- OpenUnlock NFC — Tasker project (fallback path).
     Primary trigger is the OpenUnlock app itself in NFC reader mode:
     tap a client phone to the host phone and the app detects it and
     runs its default action + the wireless-ADB flow. This Tasker
     project is the FALLBACK for when the app is not open in reader mode.
     Each profile fires on ANY NFC tag (event code 600, blank tag ID)
     and opens the matching openunlock:// deep link in the app.
     Honest limit: a client phone randomizes its tag UID per tap, so an
     NFC profile can never reliably match one specific client — that is
     why the app's reader mode is primary and this is fallback only.
     Task "OU CLI FRP status (Termux)" runs the Python CLI in Termux via
     the documented com.termux.RUN_COMMAND service intent; it needs the
     com.termux.permission.RUN_COMMAND permission — test it once, and if
     Termux ignores it, use the Termux:Tasker plugin action in the UI.
     Import: Tasker → Menu → Data → Import Project → this file.
     After import, re-import is needed after any XML change. -->
